### 1. Add a new product
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2001",
  "name": "Steel Nails",
  "quantity": 500
}

### 2. Update the product (Change name and quantity)
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/2001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2001",
  "name": "Premium Steel Nails",
  "quantity": 350
}

### 3. Verify the update
GET http://localhost:8080/products/2001

### Поиск несуществующего товара
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999999